rtpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\"\n    claim: [C1, C2, C3]\n    description: \"dt=1 baseline in non-locomotion DMC environment, broadening scope beyond locomotion tasks\"\n    priority: P0\n    gpu_budget_hours: 15\n    deps: []\n\n  - id: plan_051\n    name: \"Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    claim: [C1, C2]\n    description: \"Replicate delusional critic collapse in Cartpole Swingup\"\n    priority: P0\n    gpu_budget_hours: 15\n    deps: [plan_050]\n\n  - id: plan_052\n    name: \"Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    claim: [C2]\n    description: \"Replicate causal control (no dt_embedding → no collapse) in Cartpole Swingup\"\n    priority: P0\n    gpu_budget_hours: 15\n    deps: [plan_050]\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Mitigation pilot (P0)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - id: plan_060\n    name: \"Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot (Walker Walk, 1 seed)\"\n    claim: [C6]\n    description: \"Monitor RSSM prediction uncertainty during imagination rollout; truncate when exceeding threshold. Pilot feasibility test on Walker Walk with dt=2 + subsample ON. If successful, extends to multi-seed + cross-environment.\"\n    priority: P0\n    gpu_budget_hours: 5\n    deps: []\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Stretch goals (P2)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - id: plan_040\n    name: \"Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\"\n    claim: [C1, C2]\n    description: \"Third DMC environment for stronger generalization claim\"\n    priority: P2\n    gpu_budget_hours: 45\n    deps: [plan_020]\n\n# ============================================================\n# GPU Budget Summary (updated 2026-05-14)\n# ============================================================\n# P0 (must-run): ~145 GPU·h\n#   - Walker Walk MVP done: ~48h (spent)\n#   - Wa